  <item>
    <title>008.《长相思》谈亲密关系中的全能自恋。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6769160d15a5fd520ed7aba4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6769160d15a5fd520ed7aba4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Dec 2024 08:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 《长相思》诗歌诵读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 词的解释</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> 情不等于爱。情可以有很多种，而爱是唯一性和排他性的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> 关于情感的追逐与被追逐，为什么被追的一方最后陷的最深？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a> 他追你的时候，往往是对你最好的，逐渐降温的，而你却慢慢升温。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 爱可以分给很多人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 不必羡慕渣男渣女，他们甚至没有过一段真正的感情。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a> 《玫瑰的故事》 玫瑰：很有爱的能力的人。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 爱是慈悲，情是执念。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 关系越淡，处的越久。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 只有漂亮才能被爱吗？答案当然是肯定的，但不是最美的人才能被爱。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">23:32</a> 如何缓解容貌焦虑？只关注和你同类型的美女。&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls05v45ouXjt1xau4iFFCnpimfHA.m4a" length="21423087" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:12</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrRPOoMbQxTwbFOKoUkpKLSWymKy.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>8</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>007.番外[宋]焦虑内耗怎么办？听听苏轼《定风波》怎么说</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67341b3c43dc3a438734f68f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67341b3c43dc3a438734f68f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Nov 2024 03:23:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🤓前几期的唐诗听腻了吧？这次来点不一样！走进宋词，走进苏轼《定风波》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️｜写给第7期:</span></p><span></span><p><span>生命是一场无尽的探索，每一次新的尝试对我来说都是一次奇妙的体验。本期节目你将会收听到👂：1.焦虑内耗怎么办？—苏轼的“一蓑烟雨任平生”将会给你答案。2.当隐约的察觉他人的阴阳怪气？No！绝不内耗，华丽回怼。3.所谓的“高敏感”其实是拥有觉察力的天赋，这或许是你最与众不同的一点。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a> 关于拖延症，我的解决方法--建立奖励机制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 序</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 名词解释：徐行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">06:59</a> 名词解释：蓑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 名词解释：任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 名词解释：平生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 个人理解的翻译[仅供参考】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> 苏轼的“一体两面”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 断供成就了菲尔奈特--耐克公司</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="837">13:57</a> 一切都不是事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> 所有哲理都有一定的限定条件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 比自欺欺人的“万物发生皆有利于我”更客观的是“即使不有利于我，我也能接受 ''</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 关于顺势而为。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> 社会的评判机制导致我们的痛苦。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 不需要在乎他人的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 关于高敏感：说个和主流观点相悖的，当你感到不舒服，就是对方故意的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 维持一段很累的友谊对你来说有什么用呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> 警惕冷嘲热讽，院里从来不主动找你的假朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后的尾声是中国古诗词艺术歌曲《定风波》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li8KT4VrnGSHoH2dv9tsJEiWzVhI.m4a" length="31001743" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgeZ_HG8SlCfa83ieZ7xjpXowVkp.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>7</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
